した結果、同社に係るのれんに関して減損損失41億37百万円を計上する見込みです。２. 繰延税金資産の取崩しBlommerの業績動向等を踏まえ、繰延税金資産の回収可能性を慎重に検討した結果、繰延税金資産を取崩し、法人税等調整額51億25百万円を計上する見込みです。", null, "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 772000000000, "772,000", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["親会社株主に帰属する当期純利益", "ProfitLossAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 16500000000, "16,500", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり当期純利益", "EarningsPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 191.92, "191.92", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 772300000000, "772,300", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["親会社株主に帰属する当期純利益", "ProfitLossAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 11100000000, "11,100", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり当期純利益", "EarningsPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 129.1, "129.10", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["AmountChangeNetSalesIFRS", "AmountChangeNetSalesIFRS", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 300000000, "300", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["AmountChangeProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParentIFRS", "AmountChangeProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParentIFRS", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -5400000000, "5,400", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["ChangeInNetSales", "ChangeInNetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 0, "0.0", "Pure", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["ChangeInProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParentIFRS", "ChangeInProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParentIFRS", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -0.327, "32.7", "Pure", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 671207000000, "671,207", "JPY", "PriorYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["親会社株主に帰属する当期純利益", "ProfitLossAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 3863000000, "3,863", "JPY", "PriorYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり当期純利益", "EarningsPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 44.94, "44.94", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["NoteToFinancialForecast", "NoteToFinancialForecast", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "事業利益の今回修正予想数値は36,000百万円です。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["ReasonForForecastCorrection", "ReasonForForecastCorrection", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "売上高につきましては、各セグメントが堅調に推移し、概ね前回発表予想どおりとなる見込みです。事業利益につきましては、Blommer以外の業務用チョコレート事業及び植物性油脂事業の伸長はあったものの、Blommerの業績回復に時間を要していることから、前回予想をわずかに下回る見込みです。親会社の所有者に帰属する当期利益につきましては、「１. 減損損失の計上」及び「２. 繰延税金資産の取崩し」を踏まえ、前回予想を下回る見込みです。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["FiscalYearEnd", "FiscalYearEnd", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2026-03-31", null, "CurrentYearInstant"]]}}